WEBVTT

00:13:29.036 --> 00:13:32.676
that will ultimately motivate
us to actually make it happen.

00:13:32.716 --> 00:13:37.076
What do you see as the thing that's going
to make the tide finally change?

00:13:37.076 --> 00:13:40.396
RS: I think we have to build
radically different systems.

00:13:40.996 --> 00:13:43.356
That's why I'm obsessed
with the workplace,

00:13:43.396 --> 00:13:45.836
because I think the workplace
is an example

00:13:45.836 --> 00:13:48.876
of how we have to resist
going back to the old normal,

00:13:48.916 --> 00:13:50.596
because there’s actually alignment.

00:13:50.596 --> 00:13:52.956
Nobody wants to go back
to that old workplace.

00:13:52.956 --> 00:13:55.076
Not men, not trans people,

00:13:55.116 --> 00:13:57.996
not, you know, nonbinary,
not my people of color,

00:13:58.036 --> 00:14:00.636
like, nobody, that wasn't
working for anybody.